<title>UK: Hyundai to create 700 jobs in Scotland - PA.</title>
<headline>Hyundai to create 700 jobs in Scotland - PA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean electronics group Hyundai is to create 700 jobs with a 900 million stg investment in two new plants in north-east Scotland, the UK's Press Association (PA) agency reported on Monday.</p>
<p>The PA said the company would produce semiconductors at the two plants at Dunfermline in the Fife region.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for comment but in July said Britain was one of two countries it had selected as candidates for a semiconductor chip plant in Europe.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
